sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Reviewer
    participant T as Taco (browser)
    participant A as Agent
    participant R as Repository sources

    A->>R: Write the plan
    A->>T: Pack a Taco (new docId)
    H->>T: Read, edit, comment on selected text
    H->>T: Click Handoff
    T-->>H: Diff + open comments (clipboard)
    H->>A: Paste the handoff
    A->>R: Check for conflicts against sourceHash
    alt No conflict
        A->>R: Apply the changes
        A->>T: Refresh the same Taco (keeps docId and comments)
        H->>T: Check round two, resolve or reply
    else Conflict
        A-->>H: Report the conflict and diff, wait for a decision
    end
